	(text "UART: adapter TX -> J201.4; RX -> J201.3; common GND.\nJ201.2 = reference only through 1k; leave open on a simple adapter.\nPower board from its own 12 V source. No 5 V UART signals.\nHold BOOT, pulse RESET, release BOOT to flash.\nEN / IO0: manual buttons or open-drain programmer outputs."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 177.8 121.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0f748b0f-0672-55f4-bcce-438bcc30af35")
	)
	(text "RTC, SD и датчики — на вложенном листе Peripherals. Силовые драйверы ещё не добавлены."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "14e6833b-037a-512a-8efd-a8c877f5352e")
	)
	(text "FAN PWM: 25 kHz, inverted at future open-drain stage.\nGPIO34/35: input only. GPIO12 held LOW for 3.3 V flash.\nPCB: antenna keepout on all copper layers per module datasheet.\nAll load drivers need hardware OFF state at reset."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 180.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "22b0c261-306f-5235-8460-e6c0278020b1")
	)
	(text "ESP32 / UART / RESET / BOOT"
